                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Too many of our neighbors are struggling with lives that have become unaffordable, from families with young children, to retirees, to homeless men and women I\u2019ve come to know.\n\nHousing, healthcare, education, and groceries are simply too expensive and inaccessible for many millions of hardworking people, and chaos at our border, in our cities, and around the world is making people afraid - and angry that no one seems to be listening.\n\nThe people I\u2019ve met, the stories I\u2019ve heard, and the possibilities I\u2019ve discovered have led to my policy platform which I\u2019ll be rolling out over the coming weeks. \n\n11/14",
