                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "National health insurance (e.g. Medicare) is NOT government run healthcare. Private hospitals deliver care, Medicare just pays for it.\n\nJust like SNAP provides EBT cards for use at grocers and bodegas, but doesn\u2019t own the stores.\n\nGovernments should focus on doing the basics better, like public safety, filling potholes, issuing driver\u2019s licenses, and improving schools before becoming grocers.",
