                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 74,
                "retweet_count": 32,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I believe in raising the foundation for struggling Americans before education and wealth disparities, accelerated by AI, result in regression or revolution.\n\n...in portable, lifelong, universal health insurance, but the private provision of care.\n\n...in a roof over every American's head, but built by the private sector.\n\n...in healthy food on every American's table. \n\n...in world-class education for every student, and parents able to choose what's best for their children.\n\n...in strong nat'l defense w/o spending $1 trillion/yr while 60% of Americans can't afford a $500 emergency.\n\n...in competent, experienced, and high integrity executives in public and private sector offices.\n\n...in public safety for all Americans, no matter one's zip code, and accountability for anyone who causes harm.\n\n...in mandatory national service, be it military, Peace Corps, or AmeriCorps.\n\n...and I believe in all of us to get it done.\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
